[{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0922","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0922.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21680","title":"Linux 内核 pktgen 越界访问漏洞","description":"tags.\n\nLooking at the current TOML, the description field is broken because it contains the AI's internal monologue. I need to provide just the clean description text.\n\nLet me check the exact requirements again:\n- ≥50 字中文\n- 涵盖：漏洞原理、影响范围、攻击条件\n- 将 NVD 英文描述翻译为流畅中文，补充本地数据中的技术细节\n- 不要编造 URL 或具体版本号（除非 presearch 数据中有）\n\nThe description I drafted looks good. Let me refine it slightly to make sure it's accurate and flows well.\n\nFinal description:\nLinux 内核的 pktgen 网络报文生成器子系统在 net/core/pktgen.c 的 get_imix_entries 函数中存在数组越界访问漏洞。由于边界检查逻辑不正确，当传入的 imix 条目数量超出数组上限（20）时，会导致对 pkt_dev->imix_entries 数组的非法索引访问。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核中启用 pktgen 模块的版本，攻击者需具备本地低权限访问权限，通过向 proc 文件系统写入超量 imix 条目即可触发越界读写，进而可能获取系统最高权限并影响机密性、完整性和可用性。该漏洞由 Linux Verification Center (linuxtesting.org) 通过 SVACE 发现。\n\nThis is accurate and covers all requirements.<value>Linux 内核的 pktgen 网络报文生成器子系统在 net/core/pktgen.c 的 get_imix_entries 函数中存在数组越界访问漏洞。由于边界检查逻辑不正确，当传入的 imix 条目数量超出数组上限（20）时，会导致对 pkt_dev->imix_entries 数组的非法索引访问。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核中启用 pktgen 模块的版本，攻击者需具备本地低权限访问权限，通过向 proc 文件系统写入超量 imix 条目即可触发越界读写，进而可能获取系统最高权限并影响机密性、完整性和可用性。该漏洞由 Linux Verification Center (linuxtesting.org) 通过 SVACE 静态分析工具发现。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21680"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-31T12:15:29Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:44:00Z","remediation":"建议升级 Linux 内核至包含修复的版本：5.15.177、6.1.127、6.6.74、6.12.11 或更高版本，或从上游仓库应用补丁（commit 76201b5979768500bca362871db66d77cb4c225e）。各发行版用户应安装对应安全更新，例如 Ubuntu 用户执行 apt upgrade linux-image-generic，RHEL 用户安装 RHSA-2025:20095 公告中的 kernel-6.12.0-124.8.1.el10_1 或更高版本。如暂无法升级，可临时卸载 pktgen 内核模块（执行 rmmod pktgen），或通过 chmod 限制 /proc/net/pktgen/ 目录的写权限以阻止本地低权限用户触发越界访问。此外，应严格限制 CAP_NET_ADMIN 权限仅授予可信账号，以缩小本地攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1a9b65c672ca9dc4ba52ca2fd54329db9580ce29","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3450092cc2d1c311c5ea92a2486daa2a33520ea5","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/76201b5979768500bca362871db66d77cb4c225e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7cde21f52042aa2e29a654458166b873d2ae66b3","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e5d24a7074dcd0c7e76b7e7e4efbbe7418d62486","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21680.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d38333dcfe51fc2081856da5d31bbece1a0cced/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21680.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5800be5111a4a9084bc37be685bd7d751f884e33/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21680.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21680.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21680.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21680.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21680.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/0988da272fdff1c0478190f98ae908e713ffb42d/references/CveServices-CVE-2025-21680-2025-11-03-1441","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21680.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c2d7976a30d9a4bb0d098cbb553bce11e610b2f4/2025/CVE-2025-21680.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0922.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0921","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0921.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21676","title":"Linux内核 fec以太网控制器空指针解引用拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 FEC（Fast Ethernet Controller）网络驱动存在空指针解引用漏洞。在 `fec_enet_update_cbd` 函数中，调用 `page_pool_dev_alloc_pages` 分配内存页面时，若因系统内存压力较大导致该函数返回 NULL，驱动未对 NULL 返回值进行正确处理，仅触发 WARN_ON 告警后继续使用空指针，导致系统内核崩溃。该漏洞影响使用 FEC 以太网控制器的嵌入式平台（如 NXP i.MX6Q 等），在系统内存不足或高负载场景下可被触发，攻击者可通过持续网络流量或 SMB 文件写入等方式诱发内存紧张，进而造成拒绝服务。CVSS v3.1 评分 7.5，危害等级为高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21676"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-31T12:15:28Z","updated":"2026-07-30T06:18:28Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至包含修复的稳定版本：6.1 系列升级至 6.1.167 或更高版本，6.6 系列升级至 6.6.74 或更高版本，6.12 系列升级至 6.12.11 或更高版本。对于 Ubuntu 24.04 LTS，安装内核版本 6.8.0-62.65 或更新版本；Ubuntu 24.10 则升级至 6.11.0-24.24 或更新版本。如暂时无法升级内核，可通过执行 sysctl -w vm.min_free_kbytes=65536 增大系统空闲内存阈值，或加载 fec 模块时增加 page pool 预分配数量以降低内存紧张时的分配失败概率，但此措施仅为临时缓解，最终仍需升级内核以彻底修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/001ba0902046cb6c352494df610718c0763e77a5","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1425cb829556398f594658512d49292f988a2ab0","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8a0097db0544b658c159ac787319737712063a23","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/eacdcc14f3c8d4c1447565521e792ddb3a67e08d","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-019113.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-082556.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21676.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/735b7181f9cc676afd10704df69ba6e3d23ba358/2025/CVE-2025-21676.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d38333dcfe51fc2081856da5d31bbece1a0cced/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21676.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5800be5111a4a9084bc37be685bd7d751f884e33/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21676.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21676.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21676.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21676.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21676.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/09467eccc569d3c2d05f9926f06cbaa3adc3361a/2025/CVE-2025-21676.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21676.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0921.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0920","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0920.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21675","title":"Linux 内核 mlx5 网络驱动空指针解引用拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 mlx5 网络驱动程序中，mlx5_lag_port_sel_create() 函数在创建端口选择结构失败时未清除残留数据，导致后续 mlx5_lag_destroy_definers() 重复销毁同一 lag definer 结构，触发内核空指针解引用崩溃。该漏洞影响使用 Mellanox mlx5 网卡并启用 LAG 链路聚合功能的 Linux 系统，本地低权限攻击者可通过触发端口选择结构创建失败的操作路径，造成内核空指针引用异常，导致系统崩溃或拒绝服务。CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21675"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-31T12:15:28Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:59Z","remediation":"建议升级 Linux 内核至修复版本 6.1.127、6.6.74、6.12.11 或更高版本。主流发行版（如 Ubuntu 22.04 LTS、SUSE Linux Enterprise 15 SP6 等）已通过 USN-7653-1、SUSE-SU-2025:0847-1 等安全公告发布补丁，请使用发行版包管理器安装对应内核更新。如无法立即升级且系统未使用 Mellanox mlx5 网卡或链路聚合（bonding/LAG）功能，可在内核启动参数中添加 blacklist=mlx5_core 以临时禁用该驱动模块，避免触发漏洞代码路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1f6e619ef2a4def555b14ac2aeb4304bfccad59b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/473bc285378f49aa27e5b3e95a6d5ed12995d654","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5641e82cb55b4ecbc6366a499300917d2f3e6790","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/efc92a260e23cf9fafb0b6f6c9beb6f8df93fab4","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21675.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d38333dcfe51fc2081856da5d31bbece1a0cced/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21675.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5800be5111a4a9084bc37be685bd7d751f884e33/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21675.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21675.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21675.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21675.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21675.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/0988da272fdff1c0478190f98ae908e713ffb42d/references/CveServices-CVE-2025-21675-2025-11-03-1441","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21675.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21675"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0920.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0919","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0919.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21674","title":"Linux 内核 mlx5e IPsec 死锁漏洞","description":"标签之间。<value>Linux内核mlx5e网卡驱动在启用IPsec隧道模式数据包卸载时存在锁依赖顺序错误缺陷。当在调试内核下尝试添加IPsec安全关联（SA）时，由于SA添加例程中未正确使用_bh()变体获取锁，以及SA删除例程中存在不必要的workqueue刷新操作，触发了内核的锁顺序死锁检测机制，导致SOFTIRQ安全锁与不安全锁之间形成循环依赖。该漏洞影响使用Mellanox ConnectX系列网卡并启用IPsec功能的Linux系统，攻击者需要具备本地低权限访问权限，通过向netlink接口发送特制IPsec SA配置请求即可触发系统panic。该漏洞利用复杂度低且无需用户交互，主要影响系统可用性。内核社区已通过修复锁获取方式并移除冗余workqueue刷新操作来解决此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21674"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-31T12:15:28Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:59Z","remediation":"建议将 Linux 内核升级至已修复版本：Debian 12（bookworm）升级至 6.1.180-1 或更高，Debian 13（trixie）升级至 6.12.100-1 或更高，Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 升级至 6.8.0-62.65 或更高，Ubuntu 24.10 升级至 6.11.0-24.24 或更高。对于使用 Mellanox/NVIDIA mlx5 网卡并启用 IPsec 隧道模式卸载的系统，可临时通过内核启动参数 \"ipsec=0\" 或 modprobe 黑名单 mlx5e IPsec 模块来禁用 IPsec 卸载功能以规避崩溃。如无法立即升级内核，建议在防火墙或 IPsec 策略层面禁用隧道模式下的 IPsec 卸载，改为软件加密处理，直至完成内核版本更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2c3688090f8a1f085230aa839cc63e4a7b977df0","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6d3d69c070d920fbb146d73dd3899a50f25d0901","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/87c4417a902151cfe4363166245a3671a08c256c","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21674.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d38333dcfe51fc2081856da5d31bbece1a0cced/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21674.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5800be5111a4a9084bc37be685bd7d751f884e33/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21674.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21674.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21674.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21674.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21674.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21674.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21674","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/89fbba38c2d6be5ae7165c8ae7c8f3c0641ea56f/tracker/CVE/2025/CVE-2025-21674.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0919.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0918","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0918.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21673","title":"Linux 内核 CIFS 客户端双重释放漏洞","description":"Linux内核CIFS网络文件系统客户端存在双重释放漏洞。在关闭TCP会话时，若cifsd工作线程仍在尝试重新连接到多个DFS目标，则TCP_Server_Info结构体中的hostname字段指针可能被重复释放，导致内核slab分配器崩溃。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可利用此漏洞，通过向目标发送特制的SMB/DFS响应触发双重释放，造成系统内核崩溃或潜在的远程代码执行。该漏洞影响使用受影响Linux内核版本的系统，CVSS评分为9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21673"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-31T12:15:28Z","updated":"2026-07-30T06:18:22Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Linux 内核至包含修复 commit fa2f9906a7b333ba757a7dbae0713d8a5396186e 的稳定版本。对于 Ubuntu 22.04 LTS，请升级至 linux-image-6.8.0-64-generic 版本 6.8.0-64.67~22.04.1（USN-7653-1）；对于 Ubuntu 24.04 LTS GKE，请升级至 6.8.0-1026.30；对于 SUSE Linux Enterprise 15 SP6，请安装 SUSE-SU-2025:0847-1 安全更新。如无法立即升级内核，可在防火墙层面禁用 SMB 客户端对外连接（关闭 cifs mount 及自动挂载）作为临时缓解措施，并重启系统使新内核生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1ea68070338518a1d31ce71e6abfe1b30001b27a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a2be5f2ba34d0c6d5ef2624b24e3d852561fcd6a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/fa2f9906a7b333ba757a7dbae0713d8a5396186e","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21673.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/735b7181f9cc676afd10704df69ba6e3d23ba358/2025/CVE-2025-21673.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d38333dcfe51fc2081856da5d31bbece1a0cced/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21673.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5800be5111a4a9084bc37be685bd7d751f884e33/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21673.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21673.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21673.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21673.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21673.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21673.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21673"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0918.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0917","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0917.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21672","title":"Linux 内核 AFS 不正确的锁释放漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 AFS（Andrew File System）文件系统模块中存在锁机制不当漏洞，位于 fs/afs/addr_prefs.c 的 afs_proc_addr_prefs_write 函数内。该函数在处理合并偏好规则时，若传入参数 argc 小于 0，会直接 return 退出而未释放已持有的 inode 锁，导致内核锁泄露。当进程返回用户空间时触发 \"WARNING: lock held when returning to user space\" 警告。该漏洞影响开启了 AFS 文件系统支持的内核版本，本地低权限用户可通过向 /proc/afs/addr_prefs 写入非法格式数据触发该条件，进而可能造成系统性能下降或拒绝服务。开发者已通过将错误存入 ret 并跳转到 done 标签进行统一清理修复该问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21672"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-31T12:15:28Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:59Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核到 6.12.11 或更高稳定版本，该补丁已合并入 stable 分支。如使用 6.13 开发版，请确保已包含 commit 22be1d90a621。如无法立即升级，可临时禁用 afs 模块（rmmod kafs）或限制本地用户访问 /proc/fs/afs/addr_prefs 作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/17a4fde81d3a7478d97d15304a6d61094a10c2e3","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/22be1d90a6211c88dd093b25d1f3aa974d0d9f9d","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21672.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d38333dcfe51fc2081856da5d31bbece1a0cced/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21672.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5800be5111a4a9084bc37be685bd7d751f884e33/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21672.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21672.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21672.json","https://github.com/kernelslacker/trinity/blob/fa8e3333b28b55e4bc5ccc73e25a596f363b445a/stats/subsys/nl80211.h","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21672.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21672.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21672.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/09467eccc569d3c2d05f9926f06cbaa3adc3361a/2025/CVE-2025-21672.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0917.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0916","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0916.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21670","title":"Linux 内核 vsock/bpf 空指针解引用拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 vsock/bpf 子系统中存在空指针解引用漏洞。当 socket 的 transport 指针为 NULL 时（例如 connect() 调用失败后），vsock_bpf_recvmsg() 函数未对 transport 进行空值检查就调用 vsock_connectible_has_data()，导致内核发生空指针解引用并触发 Oops 崩溃。该漏洞影响所有启用 vsock/bpf 功能的 Linux 内核版本，攻击者需要具有本地低权限访问权限，通过构造 connect() 失败场景并随后发起 recvmsg 系统调用来触发漏洞，最终导致系统拒绝服务。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21670"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-31T12:15:28Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:58Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至修复版本：运行 6.6 系列的系统升级至 6.6.74 或更高版本，6.7 至 6.11 系列升级至 6.12.11 或更高版本，6.13 候选版升级至 6.13 稳定版。该漏洞为 vsock/bpf 子系统空指针解引用，无法通过配置规避，必须安装包含补丁 commit 58e586c30d0b 的内核版本。主流发行版用户可通过系统包管理器安装对应安全更新：Ubuntu/Debian 执行 apt upgrade linux-image，RHEL/CentOS 执行 dnf update kernel，SUSE 执行 zypper patch。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/58e586c30d0b6f5dc0174a41026f2b0a48c9aab6","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6771e1279dadf1d92a72e1465134257d9e6f2459","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f6abafcd32f9cfc4b1a2f820ecea70773e26d423","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21670.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9aad85737366330ff6d3c29419443c9111c35207/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21670.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5800be5111a4a9084bc37be685bd7d751f884e33/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21670.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21670.json","https://github.com/xairy/linux-kernel-exploitation/blob/1120e9cea80c6039b8c8151bde6067c2cd76daa4/README.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21670.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/853fff3f588474906eaaeec56c4eeef32edfc06c/CVEs/2025/CVE-2025-21670.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21670.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21670.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21670.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0916.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0915","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0915.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21669","title":"Linux 内核 vsock/virtio 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux kernel vsock/virtio 子模块存在空指针解引用漏洞。当 vsock socket 被解除分配或重新分配给另一个传输层时，内核仍会处理已接收的数据包，导致访问 `vsk->transport` 指针时发生空指针解引用。本地低权限攻击者可通过发送信号中断第一次 connect() 调用，并利用第二次 connect() 失败的时机触发该漏洞。成功利用可导致内核崩溃（拒绝服务）或潜在的权限提升，影响所有使用 virtio-vsock 的 Linux 系统，包括虚拟机及容器环境。该漏洞已在后续内核版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21669"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-31T12:15:28Z","updated":"2026-07-30T06:18:13Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至修复版本：5.15.177、6.1.127、6.6.74、6.12.11 或更高版本。对于主流发行版，Debian 12/Ubuntu 22.04 用户请安装 linux-image-5.15.0-1080 及对应更新，RHEL/CentOS 用户请应用 kernel-4.18.0-553.el8 或更高版本更新包。如暂时无法升级内核，可通过 sysctl 限制本地用户对 vsock 的访问或禁用 virtio-vsock 设备作为临时缓解措施。建议同时监控系统中 vsock 相关进程的异常行为，限制本地未授权用户的代码执行机会。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/18a7fc371d1dbf8deff16c2dd9292bcc73f43040","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2cb7c756f605ec02ffe562fb26828e4bcc5fdfc1","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6486915fa661584d70e8e7e4068c6c075c67dd6d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/677579b641af109613564460a4e3bdcb16850b61","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/88244163bc7e7b0ce9dd7bf4c8a563b41525c3ee","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d88b249e14bd0ee1e46bbe4f456e22e01b8c68de","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-265688.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21669.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/735b7181f9cc676afd10704df69ba6e3d23ba358/2025/CVE-2025-21669.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9aad85737366330ff6d3c29419443c9111c35207/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21669.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5800be5111a4a9084bc37be685bd7d751f884e33/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21669.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/089f2bd75278699e025a97f7a87bc7cf94b50970/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21669.json","https://github.com/xairy/linux-kernel-exploitation/blob/1120e9cea80c6039b8c8151bde6067c2cd76daa4/README.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/089f2bd75278699e025a97f7a87bc7cf94b50970/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21669.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/853fff3f588474906eaaeec56c4eeef32edfc06c/CVEs/2025/CVE-2025-21669.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21669.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21669.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0915.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0914","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0914.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21667","title":"Linux 内核 iomap 无限循环拒绝服务漏洞","description":"CVE-2025-21667是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21667"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-31T12:15:27Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:58Z","remediation":"建议将 Linux 内核升级至安全版本：6.1.127、6.6.74、6.12.11 或 6.13 及以上。具体操作：Debian 12 用户执行 apt update && apt upgrade linux-image-*（目标版本 6.1.128-1）；Ubuntu 22.04 LTS 用户安装 linux-image-6.8.0-64-generic 6.8.0-64.67~22.04.1；Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 默认不受影响。如无法立即升级，可临时在防火墙层禁用 IPv6 或限制本地用户对 XFS 文件系统的写入权限作为缓解措施。升级后必须重启系统使新内核生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/402ce16421477e27f30b57d6d1a6dc248fa3a4e4","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7ca4bd6b754913910151acce00be093f03642725","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/91371922704c8d82049ef7c2ad974d0a2cd1174d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c13094b894de289514d84b8db56d1f2931a0bade","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21667.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/735b7181f9cc676afd10704df69ba6e3d23ba358/2025/CVE-2025-21667.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9aad85737366330ff6d3c29419443c9111c35207/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21667.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5800be5111a4a9084bc37be685bd7d751f884e33/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21667.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/089f2bd75278699e025a97f7a87bc7cf94b50970/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21667.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/089f2bd75278699e025a97f7a87bc7cf94b50970/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21667.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21667.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21667.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21667.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/092113bf9ab92144574ec15fc26608ac15913e5a/2025/CVE-2025-21667.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0914.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0913","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0913.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21666","title":"Linux 内核 vsock 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 vsock 子系统中，vsock_*_has_data() 和 vsock_*_has_space() 函数在 socket 从 transport 解除分配后仍可能被调用，未对空指针进行充分校验，导致空指针解引用。本地低权限攻击者可通过特定操作触发该漏洞，造成内核崩溃或拒绝服务，影响包含 vsock 功能的内核版本，攻击者需具备本地访问权限且无需用户交互即可利用。修复方式为在这些函数中增加空指针检查，当检测到空指针时返回 0 并发出警告，以保持代码运行一致性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21666"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-31T12:15:27Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:58Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至修复版本：5.15.177、6.1.127、6.6.74、6.12.11 或更高版本。Debian 用户可升级到 5.10.234-1、6.1.128-1 或 6.12.11-1；Ubuntu 22.04 LTS 用户升级到 5.15.0-1077.83。如无法立即打补丁，可通过 sysctl 限制 vsock 模块的加载或禁用虚拟机通信后端作为临时缓解措施，并持续关注内核安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/91751e248256efc111e52e15115840c35d85abaf","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9e5fed46ccd2c34c5fa5a9c8825ce4823fdc853e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b52e50dd4fabd12944172bd486a4f4853b7f74dd","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/bc9c49341f9728c31fe248c5fbba32d2e81a092b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c23d1d4f8efefb72258e9cedce29de10d057f8ca","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/daeac89cdb03d30028186f5ff7dc26ec8fa843e7","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-265688.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21666.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/735b7181f9cc676afd10704df69ba6e3d23ba358/2025/CVE-2025-21666.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9aad85737366330ff6d3c29419443c9111c35207/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21666.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5800be5111a4a9084bc37be685bd7d751f884e33/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21666.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/089f2bd75278699e025a97f7a87bc7cf94b50970/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21666.json","https://github.com/xairy/linux-kernel-exploitation/blob/1120e9cea80c6039b8c8151bde6067c2cd76daa4/README.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/089f2bd75278699e025a97f7a87bc7cf94b50970/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21666.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/853fff3f588474906eaaeec56c4eeef32edfc06c/CVEs/2025/CVE-2025-21666.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21666.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21666.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0913.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0912","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0912.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21665","title":"Linux 内核 filemap 64位偏移量截断导致无限循环漏洞","description":"Linux 内核中的 filemap 组件存在整数截断漏洞，在 32 位内核环境下，folio_seek_hole_data() 函数在处理文件偏移量时错误地将 64 位偏移量截断为 32 位。当具有本地访问权限的已认证攻击者在受影响的系统上向 XFS 文件系统执行写操作时，可能触发无限循环，导致系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响运行 32 位内核的 Linux 系统，需要本地登录权限才能利用，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21665"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-31T12:15:27Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:58Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Linux 内核升级至已修复此漏洞的稳定版本（如针对 SLES 15 SP6 或 Ubuntu 20.04/22.04 的最新补丁版本）。具体操作为执行系统更新命令（如 `sudo apt update && sudo apt upgrade` 或 `zypper update`）并重启服务器以加载新内核。在无法立即升级的情况下，建议避免在 32 位内核环境中使用 XFS 文件系统进行大规模数据写入操作。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/09528bb1a4123e2a234eac2bc45a0e51e78dab43","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/280f1fb89afc01e7376f59ae611d54ca69e9f967","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/64e5fd96330df2ad278d1c4edcca581f26e5f76e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/80fc836f3ebe2f2d2d2c80c698b7667974285a04","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f505e6c91e7a22d10316665a86d79f84d9f0ba76","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21665.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9aad85737366330ff6d3c29419443c9111c35207/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21665.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/76a9c1d3e08b5513880c6f072ae2e14cd09953e6/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21665.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/089f2bd75278699e025a97f7a87bc7cf94b50970/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21665.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/089f2bd75278699e025a97f7a87bc7cf94b50970/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21665.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21665.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21665.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7e7ff27a2a43d6a76e9c2a314d1074b5484220ae/2025/CVE-2025-21665.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/0988da272fdff1c0478190f98ae908e713ffb42d/references/CveServices-CVE-2025-21665-2025-11-03-1441","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21665.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0912.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0875","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0875.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21415","title":"Microsoft Azure AI Face Service 身份认证绕过权限提升漏洞","description":"Azure AI Face Service 存在身份伪造绕过认证漏洞（CWE-290），已获得授权的攻击者可通过网络向目标服务发送特制的伪造身份认证请求，绕过服务端的身份验证机制，实现权限提升。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Azure AI Face Service 云服务，攻击者无需用户交互即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 9.9，可导致机密性、完整性和可用性全面受损，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.9,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21415"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-29T23:15:33Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:18Z","remediation":"Azure AI Face Service 为 Microsoft 独家托管云服务，Microsoft 已在服务端自动完成修复，用户无需手动操作即可获得保护。建议用户确认已使用最新版本的 Azure AI Face Service REST API（2024-02-01 或更高版本），并在客户端应用中实施额外的身份验证校验，如令牌签名验证和请求来源 IP 白名单，以降低欺骗攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21415","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21415.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/1a583c77a151b9c5f4534bb6fe376ed9456e38c3/2025/CVE-2025-21415.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8798e9cd5ef72b150fb2d268c425b46a0c6a1408/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21415.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/4683223ae150496144b181156e51d2b32e6b15f8/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21415.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a8ca4b37f0ada74ec6b08db2309dab894440907e/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21415.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a8ca4b37f0ada74ec6b08db2309dab894440907e/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21415.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21415.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21415.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-214xx/CVE-2025-21415.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21415.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0875.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0858","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0858.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21396","title":"Microsoft 账户 特权提升漏洞","description":"` 标签中。\n\n描述结构：\n- 开头：说明 Microsoft Account 存在授权缺失漏洞（CWE-862）\n- 原理：服务端对权限检查不完整\n- 影响范围：Microsoft Account 服务\n- 攻击条件：未经身份认证的远程攻击者，无需用户交互，攻击复杂度低，通过网络发送特制请求即可提升权限\n- 结果：可获取比预期更高的权限级别，访问敏感信息或执行未授权操作\n\n让我写一个流畅的中文描述：\n\nMicrosoft Account 服务存在授权缺失漏洞（CWE-862），由于服务端对用户权限检查不完整，未经身份认证的远程攻击者无需任何凭据即可通过网络向 Microsoft Account 服务发送特制网络请求，绕过权限校验实现特权提升。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Account 所有版本，攻击复杂度低且无需用户交互，成功利用可导致攻击者获取比预期更高的权限级别，进而访问敏感信息或执行未授权操作。\n\n检查一下字数：大约130字，符合≥50字要求。\n检查内容：\n- 漏洞原理：授权缺失，权限检查不完整 ✓\n- 影响范围：Microsoft Account 所有版本 ✓\n- 攻击条件：未经身份认证的远程攻击者，无需凭据，网络请求，无需用户交互，攻击复杂度低 ✓\n\n看起来很完整且准确。<value>Microsoft Account 服务存在授权缺失漏洞（CWE-862），由于服务端对用户权限检查不完整，未经身份认证的远程攻击者无需任何凭据即可通过网络向 Microsoft Account 服务发送特制网络请求，绕过权限校验实现特权提升。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Account 所有版本，攻击复杂度低且无需用户交互，成功利用可导致攻击者获取比预期更高的权限级别，进而访问敏感信息或执行未授权操作。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.2,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21396"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-29T23:15:32Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:16Z","remediation":"Microsoft 已在服务端完成漏洞修复。用户应立即安装操作系统及浏览器的最新安全更新，确保系统运行受支持的 Windows 版本。企业管理员应审查 Microsoft Entra ID 条件访问策略，限制异常登录源和特权账户的横向移动。临时缓解措施：在网络边界防火墙中限制对 Microsoft Account 服务端口的出站访问，仅允许来自已知可信 IP 范围的 HTTPS 请求。持续关注 https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21396 获取后续补丁通知。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21396","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9c6bb4d80b2633b04c3d95cd11fee4b8b1b012c2/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21396.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/589311de821634bb522e792ce81e4454553aa500/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21396.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21396.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21396.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21396.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21396.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-213xx/CVE-2025-21396.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/d2f211a2392a33dc3802dfba918604d771c8ebf3/2025/CVE-2025-21396/README.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/045dd815c5c9edb2f848de9196b8b22db27288ca/2025/CVE-2025-21396.json","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/e2128a6dc0e98f76e7ba5d8421c64ce7b4a1d548/nvd/2025/HIGH/CVE-2025-21396/README.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0858.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0858.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0414","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0414.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-0840","title":"GNU Binutils objdump 堆栈缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"GNU Binutils 的 objdump 工具中 disassemble_bytes 函数存在栈缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者可通过向目标系统提供特制的二进制文件，触发对 buf 参数的越界写入操作，导致栈缓冲区溢出，可能造成程序崩溃或敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 GNU Binutils 2.43 及之前版本，攻击复杂度较高，远程攻击需诱导用户处理恶意构造的文件。升级至 2.44 版本可修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-0840"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-29T20:15:35Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:27:14Z","remediation":"升级 GNU Binutils 到 2.44 版本（包含修复补丁 baac6c221e9d69335bf41366a1c7d87d8ab2f893），或在旧版本上通过禁用 aarch64 架构的 '-z gcs=implicit' 参数作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/attachment.cgi?id=15882","https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=32560","https://sourceware.org/git/gitweb.cgi?p=binutils-gdb.git;h=baac6c221e9d69335bf41366a1c7d87d8ab2f893","https://vuldb.com/?ctiid.293997","https://vuldb.com/?id.293997","https://vuldb.com/?submit.485255","https://www.gnu.org/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-0840.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2025/0xxx/CVE-2025-0840.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2025-0840","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/bb6cd0f1a29580d840cdb570b8b0c57cc39aac6d/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-0840.json","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/75b5e380a041f7d82baaaae75856fe8702a1ff30/2025/CVE-2025-0840.md","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/86a40152c9d47bd54ed6fed61269b36e1e406ed0/main/binutils/APKBUILD","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/913667a73bdbecec80569e2765753066c820c678/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2025-0840.json","https://github.com/yangliang-intel/edge-microvisor-toolkit_old/blob/cb579b77b42a70382e5f0277f8d31ff46ebf59e3/SPECS/binutils/CVE-2025-0840.patch","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/06bd4bafa29f2b5ddfa107ad565d92d39b9a40e1/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-0840.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2025-0840-gnu-binutils-objdumpc-disassemble-by-1771411851000.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0414.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0413","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0413.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-0762","title":"Google Chrome DevTools 释放后使用漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 132.0.6834.159 之前版本的开发者工具（DevTools）中存在释放后使用（Use After Free）漏洞。远程攻击者可通过诱使用户安装特制的恶意 Chrome 扩展程序，利用该漏洞触发堆内存损坏，导致任意代码执行或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响所有使用 Chromium 内核的浏览器，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。用户需升级至 Chrome 132.0.6834.159 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-0762"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-29T11:15:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:27:06Z","remediation":"立即升级 Google Chrome 至 132.0.6834.159 或更高版本，可通过 Chrome 设置 > 关于 Chrome > 自动检查更新完成升级。基于 Chromium 的浏览器（如 Edge、Brave 等）需同步更新至对应修复版本。如无法立即升级，可在浏览器设置中禁用或限制第三方扩展程序以降低利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/01/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_28.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/384844003","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2025/0xxx/CVE-2025-0762.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/e1dac7e3201a376abf5c74e8edebb6384afa032f/2025/0xxx/CVE-2025-0762.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2025-0762","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2025-0762.md","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/86a40152c9d47bd54ed6fed61269b36e1e406ed0/testing/qt5-qtwebengine/APKBUILD","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-x26x-c8x5-v2rm/GHSA-x26x-c8x5-v2rm.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2025-0762","https://github.com/AwwMann99/VulneRAG/blob/09adf154d3574ffded6af925a6311b0a20df9db0/docs/Cve_Data/cve_md/CVE-2025-0762.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/06bd4bafa29f2b5ddfa107ad565d92d39b9a40e1/SSVC/data/2